Names that referred to Solr are gone: ``SolrConnectionError`` is now
``SearchConnectionError``, ``check_solr_schema_version`` is
``check_schema``, ``convert_legacy_parameters_to_solr`` is
``convert_legacy_parameters``, ``solr_literal`` is ``search_literal``,
``VALID_SOLR_PARAMETERS`` is ``VALID_SEARCH_PARAMETERS`` and
``make_connection`` has been removed. No compatibility aliases are kept.
